      "statement": "The live view and exegra prove evaluate the expressions of state-invariant and eventually claims, match the occurrences of never, precedes and eventually claims, and run the precedes monitor with the same Lean functions (claimTruth, Matcher.hit, Form.step of formal/Exegra/ProveB.lean); an expression that cannot be evaluated is a violation in both, so a claim expression dividing by zero is violated in the live view and has a counterexample in exegra prove.",
